    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d863">

                <pb facs="0997" n="903" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg903"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Riddle.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-04-11"><hi rendition="#italic">April 11,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Knapp may now come to Constantinople, since he desires it. Direct consular agent
                    at Alexandretta to send Knapp to you at Constantinople and inform Turkish
                    Government that Mr. Terrell will return as soon as possible and examine the
                    charges against Knapp.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
